    "created_at": "2016-06-07T15:01:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-07T15:01:01Z",
    "body": "Right, This is actually what we do. In this way, if there are messages in the process to be received, they will be processed before 'close()'. Of course, close() synchronously, sets a flag so that any postMessage() will be ignored.\n",
